            <ArticleTitle>Sore throat · vaginal discharge · labial ulcer · Dx?</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>400-1</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The patient complained of worsening vaginal pain and increased vaginal discharge, but reported resolution of her back and chest pain. She also said that a week earlier, she'd had a fever that reached 104° F and a sore throat. She denied urinary frequency/urgency, sexual activity, or sexual abuse.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
